+# Verification results — local environment, 2026-11-03
+
+## Evidence actually obtained
+
+- Python 3.13 / PyTorch 2.10.0+cpu, no CUDA runtime available.
+- `python -m pytest -q tests` → **14 passed, 2 deprecation warnings** (warnings originate from archived `losses.py` using `torch.cuda.amp.autocast`).
+- `git apply --check patches/vnext3_pgsma_from_vnext2_overlay.patch` against an exact copy of the archived source overlay → **passed**.
+- `python tools/install_overlay.py --repo <pristine archived overlay> --check` → **passed**.
+- `python -m compileall -q overlay tools` → **passed** (before packaging; generated cache files omitted).
+
+### Tested code paths
+
+1. Exact maximum-cardinality core matching and known recoverable conflict; no double-owned anchor.
+2. Candidate-budget exhaustion and refusal to assign an out-of-envelope, geometrically unrepresentable GT.
+3. SCPA aligned-IoU sanity and empty-GT handling.
+4. PG-SMA identity at predictor init, correction bounds, finite outputs, native/memory/PG-SMA mode invocation.
+5. First semantic optimizer step and subsequent gate activation.
+6. Separate semantic gradients from native classification-feature/weight gradients.
+7. Individually checked objective-to-parameter gradient ownership.
+8. One-class foreground/background loss and prototype-mode permutation invariance.
+9. Per-image inference independence and half-input numerical finiteness.
+10. Native PAFPN/head full synthetic forward/backward, 2 distinct synthetic GT labels.
+11. Full native SGD optimizer update and native parameter/buffer parity with and without a simultaneous separate semantic update.
+12. SPI zero-gate exact identity and nonzero gate-opening gradient.
+13. Dynamic 64×96 / 96×64 / 128×128 synthetic shape checks, and small-map contextual attention.
+14. Full overlay compiles and matches the original archived patch base.
+
+## NOT tested / not claimed
+
+- Genuine upstream `yolo_head.py`: isolated tests use a compatible test double, not your actual installed head.
+- Complete data transform/MosaicDetection/collator correctness; ignored/crowd labels, variable aspect-bucket samples, valid-padding masks and oriented boxes.
+- Real pretrained checkpoint matching, actual BDD100K/ACDC/UAV AP, AR, score ranking, NMS, or 80-epoch stability.
+- CUDA/AMP, gradient scaler, DDP, resume with a real checkpoint, actual device memory, ONNX-runtime or TensorRT export/parity/latency.
+- All 9 scientific performance requirements remain **empirical acceptance gates**.
+
+**Full training is deliberately disabled in the new experiment configuration.**
